<title>UK: EIB sets 20 billion drachma three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 20 billion drachma three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett,</p>
<p>Credito Italian (joint books) and Citibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN GDR    BASE	3M-ATHIBOR MATURITY    15.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -85 BP    PAY DATE   S30.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.35    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GREECE    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.35	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FIRST COUPON SET AT 11.25 PCT</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
